abstract: "FRAME-LINK is a structural engineering framework for fatigue reliability assessment and monitoring of structural connection systems under cyclic and dynamic loading, incorporating Paris-Erdogan fracture mechanics, Palmgren-Miner damage accumulation, and AI-assisted computational support."
